{
  "hero_headline": "AI 泡沫引发美股回调，全球科技与地缘政治动荡并存 / AI Bubble Fears Trigger Stock Selloff Amid Global Geopolitical Tensions",
  "daily_overview": "今日全球焦点汇聚在人工智能资本市场的波动与地缘政治的复杂性上。科技领域，AI 搜索对搜索广告营收的蚕食效应初显，导致科技巨头股价大幅下挫，市场对千亿美元量级的 AI 投入产出比产生深度怀疑。财经方面，全球市场对「AI 泡沫」的担忧叠加美股财报季的压力，引发科技板块抛售；同时，北韩背景的 63 亿美元加密黑客事件及资源国地缘风险进一步加剧市场不确定性。时政层面，美国中期选举临近，党派内部纷争加剧；赫尔松停火结束标志着俄乌局势的再次升级，叠加中东与欧洲多地的社会动荡，全球局势正进入一个脆弱且不稳定的震荡期。\n\nToday's global focus centers on the volatility of the AI capital market and the complexity of geopolitics. In tech, the cannibalization of search advertising revenue by AI models is becoming apparent, dragging down tech stocks as investors question the ROI of massive AI expenditures. Financially, fears of an 'AI bubble' and earnings pressure have sparked a selloff in the tech sector, while a $6.3bn crypto hack linked to North Korea and resource-related geopolitical risks increase uncertainty. Politically, the approaching US midterm elections are intensifying partisan splits, while the end of the Kherson ceasefire marks an escalation in the Russia-Ukraine conflict. Combined with social unrest in Europe and the Middle East, the world is entering a fragile period of instability.",
