  "editor_note": "AI 的造富神话正在被高昂的基建成本与营收压力戳破。在这个动荡期，学会「人机协作」而非盲目依赖 AI，是每个人保护自己职业价值的关键。/ The AI wealth myth is being deflated by high infrastructure costs and revenue pressure. In these volatile times, mastering human-AI collaboration rather than blind reliance is key to preserving your career value.",
